Rogerb posted how an artifact's alignment is determined.

But please don't view it as a change.  That artifact is set to
that at the beginning of the game before it exists so it never
changes.

If you're not a valkyrie then Mjollnir is neutral.  If you are a
valkyrie then Mjollnir is whatever your starting alignment is.

Same for wizard - If you're not a wizard then Magicbane is
neutral.  If you are a wizard than Magicbane is whatever
your starting alignment is.

For each class that can be more than one alignment, lather
rinse repeat for their Quest artifact.  For the other classes
that get a first gift lather rinse repeat for their first gift.

The thing is the artifact "is" that alignment from before the
first move of the game.  It doesn't change in the usual sense.


